Cut Through for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Cut Through (26.3.0) by Fuzs.
Original source: https://github.com/Fuzss/cut-through
Original licence: MPL-2.0 (the original's assets are All Rights Reserved)

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the targeting rules are implemented in Rust on Sunrise's
typed mod API (no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the same
licence as the original (MPL-2.0); the licence text is in LICENSE.

None of the original project's All-Rights-Reserved assets are included: the mod icon is
original work for this port, and the language file is written for this port.
